# Local env files. `.env*` already covers these two, but they are the ones that
# hold the Neon URL, JWT_SECRET and the Cloudinary API secret, so they are named
# explicitly. `.env.example` is the only env file that belongs in git.
.env.local
.env*.local
.env*
!.env.example

